/**
 * @mainpage TIVIDY Workflow Engine
 *
 * TIVIDY is a modular C++ workflow engine demonstrating workflow construction
 * and execution, state management, approvals, adapters, decorators, and
 * related design patterns. The `scenarios` module provides sample insurance
 * and education workflows, while `tui` contains the interactive text
 * interface.
 *
 * @section building Building
 * Configure and build the project with CMake:
 * @code
 * cmake -S . -B build
 * cmake --build build
 * @endcode
 *
 * @section generating_docs Generating this documentation
 * From the repository root, run:
 * @code
 * doxygen Doxyfile
 * @endcode
 * The HTML documentation is written to `docs/api`.
 */
